2. System Architecture & Class Diagram (architecture.puml)
Represents the code structure, global configuration entities, and shared memory model.

@startuml architecture_diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Global State (Shared Memory)" {
    class Configuration <<Dictionary>> {
        + config_hardware : Dict
        + config_logging : Dict
        + config_timing : Dict
    }
    
    class SharedData <<Dictionary>> {
        + timestamp : String
        + sensors : List
        + status : String
        + buffer_size : Integer
    }
    
    class CSV_Buffer <<Deque>> {
        + append(row)
        + popleft()
    }
}

package "Processes" {
    class DAQ_Engine <<Daemon Thread>> {
        - nidaqmx_task : Task
        - worksheet : GSpread.Worksheet
        + run()
        - connect_to_cloud()
        - handle_csv_write()
    }

    class Web_Server <<Flask Main Thread>> {
        + route_login()
        + route_dashboard()
        + route_settings()
        + route_api_data()
    }
}

package "External Hardware/Services" {
    class NI_Hardware {
        + cDAQ1Mod1
    }
    class Google_Cloud {
        + Sheets API
    }
    class Local_FS {
        + thermocouple_data.csv
    }
}

' Relationships
Web_Server ..> Configuration : Reads/Writes (via Settings)
DAQ_Engine ..> Configuration : Reads (Runtime)

DAQ_Engine --> SharedData : Updates
Web_Server --> SharedData : Reads (via API)

DAQ_Engine --> CSV_Buffer : Pushes (on Lock)
DAQ_Engine --> CSV_Buffer : Pops (on Retry)

DAQ_Engine --> NI_Hardware : Reads
DAQ_Engine --> Google_Cloud : Uploads
DAQ_Engine --> Local_FS : Writes

@enduml